{"availability":"available","full":"pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site","name":"felix-ds-demo-site","description":"Demo healthcare website built on FKUI components with the felix-ds theme – Vue 3, TypeScript, light/dark mode, client-side search, prerendered routes.","category":"Design","language":"Vue","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-19T19:32:18Z","updated":"2026-10-15T19:15:02Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pattespatte.github.io/felix-ds-demo-site/","topics":["demo","design-system","typescript","vite","vue"],"demo":"https://pattespatte.github.io/felix-ds-demo-site/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.209Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.209Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.209Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:23:50.251Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:00:03.582Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.209Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A demo website built with felix-ds – a thin theme layer on top of FKUI's public npm packages – showing that the theme holds up on a realistic, content-heavy site.","The site is a fictional Swedish healthcare portal (\"Vårdportalen\"): 25 content pages plus a 404 page, with a bilingual-safe, Swedish-only content set, client-side search, prerendering for no-JS visitors, and light/dark color modes driven entirely by the felix theme tokens.","Everything here is fictional – the clinic, prices, people and contact details are made up. The site is kept out of search indexes (noindex meta, robots.txt, X-Robots-Tag headers)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c1cbb2a9e72f45fb520627fd4563278521156bac7c1053620ef86ccb3956bb09","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.336Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.336Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A demo website built with felix-ds – a thin theme layer on top of FKUI's public npm packages – showing that the theme holds up on a realistic, content-heavy site.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Authentication is a GitHub personal access token with Contents read/write on this repo – no OAuth server needed, which is why Sveltia over Decap on GitHub Pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The CMS bundle is self-hosted and version-pinned: @sveltia/cms is a devDependency, and scripts/sync-sveltia-cms.mjs (run by dev and build) copies it from nodemodules into public/admin/ (gitignored).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c1cbb2a9e72f45fb520627fd4563278521156bac7c1053620ef86ccb3956bb09","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.336Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T19:15:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pattespatte/felix-ds-demo-site/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.337Z","hash":"c1cbb2a9e72f45fb520627fd4563278521156bac7c1053620ef86ccb3956bb09","originalBytes":7367,"storedBytes":7367,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:45:12.209Z","subjects":["Templates & UI components"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Templates & UI components"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Templates & UI components","source":"metadata","match":"theme"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Animation & motion","Automation & workflows","Self-hosted apps"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://pattespatte.github.io/felix-ds-demo-site/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-1